          "text": "<b>ALPHA BEGINS!</b>\nThank you for support Infinity and for being brave and crazy enough to join us Alpha testing! Check <b>www.AQ.com</b> for the latest news. \n\n<b>New Intro</b>\nTest the story, cutscenes, and combat of our remastered version of the original AQWorlds intro. \n\n<b>Classes</b>\nThe 4 base classes have been remastered. Instead of having two separate version of Warrior, there is now one version which has a blend of classic and Infinity-only skills. \n\n\u2022 Improved Warrior Class\n\u2022 Improved Mage Class\n\u2022 Improved Rogue Class\n\u2022 Improved Healer Class\n\u2022 Next round of classes coming soon.\n\nYou can get them from the Class Shop to test.\n\n<b>Bludrut Keep</b>\nConquer all 4 floors of Bludrut Keep in a remastered story. Earn the legendary Bludrut Blade. \n\n<b>Dragon's Lair</b>\nJoin Galanoth the DragonSlayer as you quest through the lair to slay the Red Dragon. \n\n<b>Known Bugs/Issues</b>\n\u2022 Bugs? Hah! We never have any of those....\n\u2022 But just in case we do, I will add them here for you. ",
          "hideLead": true,
          "borderless": false,
          "addNameplate": false,
          "changeNameplate": "",
